#api call for admin user

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/user/admin/
Content-Type: application/json


{
    "username":"achu",
    "email":"achu@gamil.com",
    "password":"achu"
}

# api call for listing

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/booking/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic achu:achu

# api call for adding

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/booking/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic achu:achu

{
    "name":"abhiii",
    "location":"mkd",
    "phone":"743485430",
    "fee":"1200"
}

