###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/booking/5/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic achu:achu


#api call for update

###
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/booking/4/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic achu:achu

{  
   "name":"achu",
    "location":"pkd",
    "phone":"6574843343",
    "fee":"1500" 
}

