#api call for listing

###
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/booking/turfbooking/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic user:user@123

# api call for adding

###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/booking/turfbooking/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic user:user@123

{
    "team_name":"royal",
    "turf":4,
    "phone_number":"12345678",
    "email":"royal@gmail.com",
    "date":"2026-10-10",
    "start_time":"16:00:00",
    "match_duration":"01:00:00"

}


#api call for retrieve

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/booking/turfbooking/2/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic user:user@123


# api call for update

###
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/booking/turfbooking/2/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic user:user@123

{
  "id": 2,
  "team_name": "barcelona",
  "phone_number": "12345678",
  "email": "barcelona@gmail.com",
  "date": "2026-10-10",
  "start_time": "15:00:00",
  "end_time": "16:00:00",
  "match_duration": "01:00:00",
  "turf": 4
}


# api call for delete

###
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/booking/turfbooking/3/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic user:user@123

